  "cards": [
    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "dot": "emerald",
      "items": [
        "1. Add your app's URL and login — Vantage crawls it and builds a metadata model of every page and flow",
        "2. LLM groups that metadata into candidate journeys — you validate & acknowledge before continuing",
        "3. LLM drafts test scenarios from the approved journey — you validate & acknowledge before continuing",
        "4. LLM compiles the approved scenarios into runnable Playwright test code",
        "5. You run every test with one click and review pass / fail results"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Human-in-the-loop, by design",
      "dot": "slate",
      "items": [
        "Journeys and Scenarios are checkpoints — the LLM's draft always pauses for your review before the next stage starts",
        "At either checkpoint you can rename or delete what the LLM drafted before you acknowledge and proceed"
      ]
    }
  ]
